<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe lightning deaths rise to 64.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe lightning deaths rise to 64.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six people were killed by lightning in Zimbabwe in the past two weeks, bringing to 64 the number of lightning casualties since the November-April rainy season started, police said on Monday.</p>
<p>More than 200 people are killed by lightning every rainy season in the southern African country.</p>
